; Immersive Quest Markers unlocalizers
;
; Exposes the locals the FOR HIRE card needs to match the paid-escort dialogue
; without calling into it. txr_paid_companions pins each squad's price multiplier
; and hire verdict in `dialog_squad`, and the payment phrases the player actually
; sees are gated on that multiplier times the base prices - all four of them file
; locals, so there is no read-only way to know whether the offer dead-ends on cost.
;
;   dialog_squad  - [squad.id] = { money = <price multiplier>, can_work = "true"/"false" }
;   money_1_base  - base price for the 24h hire (the multiplier is applied to it)
;   money_2_base  - base price for the 48h hire
;
; Unlocalizing REQUIRES modded exes (themrdemonized / GAMMA ships them). Without
; them this file is simply never read: iqm_core checks for dialog_squad and
; falls back to carding without the affordability check or the price, so nothing
; breaks on bare Anomaly.
;
; Modded binaries: https://github.com/themrdemonized/xray-monolith

[txr_paid_companions]
dialog_squad
money_1_base
money_2_base
